acing Game", "keywords": ["cargame", "carracing", "speedxcar", "cardrift", "racinggame"], "long_description": "\ud83d\udd25 Welcome to SpeedX VR Car Racing Game, the ultimate car racing game for VR racing fans who love speed, drifting, and competitive track racing action.\n\n\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f Drive powerful sports cars on exciting racing tracks and experience realistic car racing game physics with smooth controls, fast acceleration, and intense drifting gameplay. Race through challenging tracks, master sharp corners, and become a true racing champion.\n\n\ud83d\udca8 This immersive VR car racing game delivers nonstop racing excitement with realistic drift mechanics, detailed race environments, tire smoke effects, and fast-paced gameplay designed for players who love sports car racing and drift racing games.\n\n\ud83c\udfae Whether you enjoy realistic driving simulators, arcade racing games, drift racing challenges, or competitive track racing, SpeedX VR Car Racing Game offers an exciting virtual reality racing experience packed with action.\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Features\n\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f Realistic VR car racing game experience\n\ud83d\udca8 Smooth drift racing and track racing gameplay\n\ud83d\udd25 High-speed sports car racing action\n\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Detailed racing tracks and immersive environments\n\ud83c\udfae Exciting virtual reality racing gameplay\n\ud83d\ude98 Realistic car handling and racing physics\n\u26a1 Competitive racing challenges and drift action\n\ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f Dynamic tire smoke and drift effects\n\ud83c\udfc1 Fast-paced car racing game mechanics\n\nStart your engine and enjoy one of the most exciting VR car racing game experiences with intense track racing and drift racing action in SpeedX VR Car Racing Game! \ud83c\udfc6", "short_description": "\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f Enjoy the ultimate car racing game with high-speed track racing, realistic drifting, sports cars, and immersive VR racing action in SpeedX VR Car Racing Game."}]}, "developer_name"